        "headline": "Small Craft Advisory issued October 4 at 6:32PM AKDT until October 5 at 1:00AM AKDT by NWS Juneau AK",
        "description": "* WHAT...For the first Small Craft Advisory, seas 7 to 9 ft. For\nthe second Small Craft Advisory, seas 6 to 9 ft expected.\n\n* WHERE...Cape Fairweather to Icy Cape from 15 to 80 NM and Icy\nCape to Cape Suckling from 15 to 80 NM.\n\n* WHEN...For the first Small Craft Advisory, until 1 AM AKDT\nMonday. For the second Small Craft Advisory, from 7 AM Monday\nto 6 AM AKDT Tuesday.\n\n* IMPACTS...Conditions will be hazardous to small craft.",
